er/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 05-05-2023, 10:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-05T09:52:10-07:00","id":1510801,"title":"","content":"Maybe it's a boarding school or a campus, and his vice could deal with the daylight tasks.<br /> <br /> But if it's too unrealistic, maybe he's a teacher which holds night classes instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-05T11:12:46-07:00","id":1510808,"title":"","content":"I think in this case you should go for the obvious, either you attack students or staff in isolated areas, like a janitor in the broom closet, or students hiding in the back of a building to do something hidden; another option is to make an agreement with some students or even their parents, for example recommending a scholarship or internship, turning a blind eye to problems that they have or possible absences or even extending the deadline for delivering work or talking to a teacher not to fail them, it might even yield a story of someone trying to figure out this schemes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2